zation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one or two areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Semiconductor devices"},{"text":"Analog IC design"},{"text":"Digital VLSI"},{"text":"Nanoelectronics"},{"text":"MEMS"},{"text":"Semiconductor sensors"},{"text":"Power electronics"},{"text":"RF/microwave ICs"},{"text":"Photonic devices"},{"text":"Quantum devices"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Complete a research-oriented final-year project."}]},{"heading":"Semiconductor Physics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong R&D Engineer needs more than circuit knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Semiconductor Fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy bands"},{"text":"Bandgap"},{"text":"Fermi level"},{"text":"Carrier concentration"},{"text":"Drift"},{"text":"Diffusion"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Recombination"},{"text":"Generation"},{"text":"Doping"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Device Physics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PN junction"},{"text":"Diode"},{"text":"BJT"},{"text":"MOS capacitor"},{"text":"MOSFET"},{"text":"FinFET"},{"text":"Gate-all-around concepts"},{"text":"Semiconductor heterostructures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Device Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wide-bandgap semiconductors"},{"text":"GaN"},{"text":"SiC"},{"text":"2D materials"},{"text":"Nanowires"},{"text":"Quantum wells"},{"text":"Quantum dots"},{"text":"Tunnel devices"}]}]},{"heading":"Microelectronics & VLSI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Digital VLSI"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CMOS logic"},{"text":"Combinational circuits"},{"text":"Sequential circuits"},{"text":"Flip-flops"},{"text":"Counters"},{"text":"FSMs"},{"text":"Memories"},{"text":"Standard cells"},{"text":"Timing"},{"text":"Power"},{"text":"Area optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analog IC Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Current mirrors"},{"text":"Differential pairs"},{"text":"Operational amplifiers"},{"text":"Biasing"},{"text":"Common-source amplifiers"},{"text":"Feedback"},{"text":"Noise"},{"text":"Frequency response"},{"text":"ADC/DAC fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"VLSI Design Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Specification","Architecture","RTL / Circuit Design","Simulation","Synthesis","Verification","Physical Design","Layout","DRC / LVS","Tape-out","Fabrication","Testing / Characterization"]}]},{"heading":"Semiconductor Fabrication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the major fabrication stages:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wafer preparation"},{"text":"Oxidation"},{"text":"Deposition"},{"text":"Photolithography"},{"text":"Etching"},{"text":"Ion implantation"},{"text":"Diffusion"},{"text":"Metallization"},{"text":"CMP"},{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the purpose of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cleanrooms"},{"text":"Process control"},{"text":"Critical dimensions"},{"text":"Contamination control"},{"text":"Yield"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student does not need industrial fabrication access to learn the concepts, but practical cleanroom/lab exposure is extremely valuable."}]},{"heading":"Nanoelectronics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nanoscale device physics"},{"text":"Quantum confinement"},{"text":"Surface effects"},{"text":"Tunnelling"},{"text":"Nanoscale transistors"},{"text":"Nanomaterials"},{"text":"2D materials"},{"text":"Carbon nanotubes"},{"text":"Graphene"},{"text":"Nanowires"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Explore emerging device architectures:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinFET"},{"text":"Gate-All-Around FET"},{"text":"Nanosheet FET"},{"text":"CFET concepts"},{"text":"Tunnel FETs"},{"text":"Spintronic devices"},{"text":"Neuromorphic devices"}]}]},{"heading":"Device Characterization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important R&D skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to measure:"},{"type":"h","text":"Electrical Characteristics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"I-V"},{"text":"C-V"},{"text":"Leakage current"},{"text":"Threshold voltage"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Breakdown voltage"},{"text":"On/off ratio"},{"text":"Subthreshold characteristics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reliability"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Temperature effects"},{"text":"Bias stress"},{"text":"Electromigration"},{"text":"Dielectric breakdown"},{"text":"Aging"},{"text":"Thermal reliability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Instruments"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Semiconductor parameter analyzer"},{"text":"Source-measure unit"},{"text":"Oscilloscope"},{"text":"LCR meter"},{"text":"Probe station"},{"text":"Function generator"},{"text":"Spectrum analyzer"},{"text":"Network analyzer"}]}]},{"heading":"Simulation & EDA Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Tool/Skill","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"LTspice / SPICE"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"MATLAB"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Cadence"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Synopsys Tools"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"TCAD"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Verilog/SystemVerilog"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on specialization, tools may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cadence Virtuoso"},{"text":"Synopsys"},{"text":"Siemens EDA"},{"text":"Silvaco TCAD"},{"text":"Keysight tools"},{"text":"COMSOL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tool availability varies between universities and employers."}]},{"heading":"Programming & Data Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","tex